OL,3,GNEWSAMan accused of murdering Chloe    
OL,4,AMitchell lied repeatedly, court hears  
OL,6,FThis article contains details that some
OL,7,Fmay find distressing                   
OL,9,FA man accused of murdering Chloe       
OL,10,FMitchell killed her before "lying      
OL,11,Frepeatedly" to police, a court has been
OL,12,Ftold.                                  
OL,14,FBrandon Rainey, formerly of James      
OL,15,FStreet in Ballymena, denies a charge of
OL,16,Fmurder and a charge of preventing the  
OL,17,Flawful burial of her remains.          
OL,19,FThe 30-year-old defendant sat in the   
OL,20,Fdock in Belfast Crown Court wearing a  
OL,21,Fgrey tracksuit and flanked by two      
OL,22,Fprison officers.                       
